<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-27T15:24:55.091Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:24:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to raid villages in Nigeria, with attacks in Plateau State killing at least 22 people and injuring several others, while bandits razed the Zonzi community in Niger State, leaving three dead. Security officials in Plateau condemned the raid and directed operatives to protect lives, and the governor of Niger State ordered protection for residents after the Zonzi attack. In Edo, gunmen opened fire on a political gathering, wounding one supporter. The conflict remains intense, with 1,486 battle-related deaths recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNTHRIOXFBRXE1M1RqOTFHZXZkVHc2Tzh4T0lqVlVndDhLYjZDT01INE1BM1FBSWxpMFVyMkFkUFEwVHFDcnFfblBmTmdWR3FFNGRPSzU1UFV6SFdBVm9iUEJHNko5M2hLUjhvWTUweTNyTGNoZlNlZWVESk9IWTBBV1dWNVhEVUxDMW51Mi0ydUdnbEZhbmVyREJzNngwZHkwVHFEdmZzaUh3RjA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;صوت الإمارات&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE41RFNBX2FKdlYyd2JRWGRHTldtR0xRMmRVcHcyMHVJcnFEbjlubUpFazBwUFFmNkF4Tmd0SlowN1gteFBLOUF1czY3dTl2dHJKRTdhWVFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Times Of Bangladesh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQMmgydUszUWlMRlpUZU01NkZQSnliY29iMFN3UEhnTGFoRXZyTkhuZmtYclZoTmVtd0oxbEpBLXdVdjYwR1hlMzdhSWY4WVFNSGJCbTlkSTdrbDFod0l3NTlIN3AxRHI3ZXdITGxoV1dtRVc4TEt0elpQcnVsZzVMSlU4RzBaUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Eye&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNS01KVTUtTWNBSDFIMF9IaGx1Mi1QR1VPQVc2eUtSeExSS1F1OF9UbUpyQkFDMUYyOEp2YVJOaC1zQm52WEZpTDR6aUQtZVJnZ0NTbUctallzRW1IelpTT3YyamZlT09vbW9GV1E1Wnd5T2FjZzEtV0VTcVhHdzJ0Sm10VzNBTDBZYXF4a1Z1WFl5ZXBiQXM3N3UySQ?oc=5&quo